%  Relevant files
InitCondFile  	          tests/EvrardCollapse/box.ic

% CPU-time limit

TimeLimitCPU              36000
MaxMemSize                2000

% Code options

GravityConstantInternal 1.0
ArtBulkViscConst        0.8

%  Caracteristics of run

TimeBegin                 0.0
TimeMax	                  3.0

BoxSize                   1


% Output frequency

TimeBetSnapshot           0.1
TimeOfFirstSnapshot       0

% Memory allocation

PartAllocFactor           2.5

% System of units

UnitLength_in_cm          1.0
UnitMass_in_g             1.0
UnitVelocity_in_cm_per_s  1.0

% Softening lengths

SofteningGas              0.004       % only gas is used here

SofteningGasMaxPhys       0.004
